{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"科摩罗","country_iso":"COM","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:48.136808","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"COM-HB-0001","ldc":"Yes","location":"昂儒昂","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"科摩罗昂儒昂光伏综合能源项目","project_name_en":"Comoros Anjouan Integrated Photovoltaic Energy Project","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"东方国际","content":"新国别科摩罗最大综合能源项目生效\n近日，由东方国际承建的科摩罗昂儒昂光伏综合能源总承包项目收到业主全额预付款，标志着东方国际进入科摩罗签约的首个项目正式生效。该项目是世行资金支持下科摩罗最大的综合能源发电项目，采用“东方造”N型双面双玻组件，工作范围包括在大科摩罗岛、昂儒昂岛和莫埃利岛建设三座分布式电站，并配套建设生活供水管路及部分输电线路。项目建成投运后，将有效缓解当地缺电、缺水问题。其中，距离该国首都莫罗尼约20公里的大科摩罗岛电站，可为该地区提供稳定电力支撑，进一步提升居民生活质量。","content_sha256":"24e5c60e9811bda101a195e0c09ccdc33eb88428f4ddbf7faa82e8b2b4de6682","id":467,"publish_date":"2026-01-13 09:26:38","title":"东方国际科摩罗最大综合能源项目生效","title_sha256":"c619f854ec53a5b56c0d7959d5e1b4199de92939d7e452985c4f2d049a960c2c","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/91743.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"COM-HB-0001","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:36:48.136859","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"COM-HB-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.seetao.com/details/256579.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"东方国际（集团）有限公司","project_developer_en":"Orient International","project_stage":"签约","project_summary":"东方国际在科摩罗承建了该国最大的综合能源项目，该项目包括在大科摩罗岛、昂儒昂岛和莫埃利岛建设三座分布式光伏电站，并配套建设供水管路及输电线路。项目建成后将有效缓解当地缺电、缺水问题。","publish_date":"2026-01-13 09:26:38","pv_capacity_mw":nu